  "description": "PDF export for MgSoftDev.KnowledgeHub, rendered by Chromium through Playwright: the PDF looks exactly like the reader, CSS themes included, with no HTML-to-document mapper to maintain. The browser can come from the already-installed Microsoft Edge, from a copy bundled with your app (offline installs), from Playwright's cache, or be downloaded on demand. Cover, header and footer are defined by the host. Optional: register it to enable the export button, or implement IKnowledgeHubPdfRenderer yourself.",
